{
  "user_message": "How much the Chatgpt consumes energy per query?",
  "chatbot_response": "Large language models like ChatGPT consume significantly more energy than a typical Google search. According to estimates, they use roughly 10 times more energy per query, which translates to around 10 kilowatt-hours (kWh) of electricity per interaction. To put this into perspective, that's equivalent to the energy needed to power a 10-watt light bulb for 100 hours.",
  "agent_state": "educator",
